  "prefLabel": "He-P 4021.15 Reports of Planned Special Exposures",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 4021.15 Reports of Planned Special Exposures. The licensee or registrant shall submit a written report to DHHS/RHS within 30 days following any planned special exposure conducted in accordance with He-P 4020.10, informing DHHS/RHS that a planned special exposure was conducted and indicating the date the planned special exposure occurred and the information required by He-P 4021.06.\n\nSource. #5903, eff 2-1-95; ss by #6827, eff 8-6-98; ss by #8481, eff 11-5-05; ss by #10604, eff 5-23-14; ss by #14091, eff 10-1-24",
